# Allow-list: `dof adopt` imports only these paths from ~/.gemini.
#
# The target is all of ~/.gemini because agy scatters its files across that
# directory, but almost nothing there belongs in git — hence the allow-list.
#
# ── Deliberately NOT listed ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# config/AGENTS.md   The global working agreement. It does live at
#                    ~/.gemini/config/AGENTS.md, but only as a symlink into
#                    ~/.config/agents/ — the hub the `agents` tool deploys.
#                    Adopting it would copy the content in here and create a
#                    second source of truth for a file that already has one.
#                    See notes/ai-context.md.
#
# config/config.json Mode 0600. Treat as credentials.
# oauth_creds.json   Credentials (also caught by .gitignore).
# google_accounts.json, installation_id, projects.json
#                    Machine-local identity and state.
# history/, tmp/, antigravity-cli/{brain,conversations,cache,crashes,log}/
#                    Conversation logs, caches, crash dumps.
#
# An earlier version listed `GEMINI.md`, which exists on neither machine:
# agy reads AGENTS.md, and under config/, not at the ~/.gemini root.

antigravity-cli/settings.json
